  "about": "Caption styles on both phones. frames: Captions.frameFor(style, t, span) - a word t seconds after it started (below 0 before it) when it takes span seconds: its scale, alpha and fill. pop: unseen at 0.6 before it starts, then 0.6 to 1.08 over the first 0.09 s and back to 1 over the next 0.09 s, straight lines. karaoke and typewriter: filled (typed) t/span of the way, 0 before, 1 after. highlightWord: 1 while said. Others: 1, 1, 0. progress: Captions.wordProgress(cue, t) - each word's seconds since it started and its span, the words sharing the cue's time evenly. letters: how many of count letters a fill covers, rounded up (less 1e-9). shown: the spans Captions.shown draws on a white caption box with the one cue, playing at t (no still), as [start, end, colour or null, scale or null]; a typewriter word's untyped letters and a pop word not yet said are the box colour at alpha 0, written alpha last. placed: Captions.placed for a box w x h on a 1080 x 1920 page - x centred; top 6% down, middle centred, bottom 6% up from the bottom, safe resting on the safe area's bottom [x, y, w, h] or as bottom with none.",
